hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1583","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala al-Sadafi told me, Ibn Wahb told me, Yunus told me, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, Sa`id bin al-Musayyab told me, and Abu Salamah bin Abdul Rahman, that Abu Hurairah said: I heard the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, saying: “If the imam believes, then they believe, so who His security coincided with the security of the angels. He was forgiven for his previous sins.”"
